{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bird Like",
    "steam_appid": 3823150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you soar peacefully above a vast ocean, following the path of ancient ruins, the world suddenly begins to collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thunder cracks the sky, volcanoes erupt, and flaming hail rains down from above.<br>And beyond all that\u2014comes the apocalyptic fall of a star, cloaked in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird Like</strong> is a roguelite flight game about pushing forward through an unraveling world to reach the end\u2014whatever it may be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have only one flight to survive the chaos.<br>Time is running out.<br>The most important thing is\u2014<strong>keep going</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, intuitive controls</strong><br>Easily control your plane with just WASD or arrow keys. Perfect for quick pick-up-and-play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly through cataclysm</strong><br>Thunderstorms, volcanic eruptions, flaming hail, collapsing ruins, and the final, starborn calamity.<br>Survive increasingly intense natural disasters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five unique aircraft</strong><br>Choose from five planes, each with distinct stats and handling. Find the one that suits your playstyle best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite upgrade system</strong><br>Craft your build each run with a variety of powerful upgrades and mysterious artifacts.<br>Strengthen your plane and push further every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable skins</strong><br>Collect and equip skins to personalize your aircraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A journey to the edge of the world</strong><br>Each session takes you deeper through ruins and storms toward an unknown destination.<br>What awaits at the end? Will you make it that far?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you soar peacefully above a vast ocean, following the path of ancient ruins, the world suddenly begins to collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thunder cracks the sky, volcanoes erupt, and flaming hail rains down from above.<br>And beyond all that\u2014comes the apocalyptic fall of a star, cloaked in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bird Like</strong> is a roguelite flight game about pushing forward through an unraveling world to reach the end\u2014whatever it may be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have only one flight to survive the chaos.<br>Time is running out.<br>The most important thing is\u2014<strong>keep going</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, intuitive controls</strong><br>Easily control your plane with just WASD or arrow keys. Perfect for quick pick-up-and-play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly through cataclysm</strong><br>Thunderstorms, volcanic eruptions, flaming hail, collapsing ruins, and the final, starborn calamity.<br>Survive increasingly intense natural disasters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five unique aircraft</strong><br>Choose from five planes, each with distinct stats and handling. Find the one that suits your playstyle best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite upgrade system</strong><br>Craft your build each run with a variety of powerful upgrades and mysterious artifacts.<br>Strengthen your plane and push further every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable skins</strong><br>Collect and equip skins to personalize your aircraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A journey to the edge of the world</strong><br>Each session takes you deeper through ruins and storms toward an unknown destination.<br>What awaits at the end? Will you make it that far?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Bird Like is a casual roguelite flight game where you soar toward destination, dodging all kinds of obstacles along the way. Pick upgrades, equip mysterious artifacts, and build your own path. What awaits at the edge of the world? Time is running out. The most important thing is\u2014just keep going.",
